      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "6db40878",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "6db40878"
      },
      "source": [
        "### **10.2 Defining a function with def**\n",
        "\n",
        "Use def name(params): to define a function."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "id": "859935e5",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "859935e5"
      },
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "def add(a, b):\n",
