      },
      "source": [
        "### 10.3 Parameters and arguments\n",
        "\n",
        "Parameters are placeholders; arguments are actual values passed in."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "id": "18ec2b45",
